787
00:39:27,761 --> 00:39:29,260
So many people came from Hong Kong.

788
00:39:29,261 --> 00:39:30,630
I guess people come
here a lot from Hong Kong.

789
00:39:30,631 --> 00:39:31,960
I placed one.

790
00:39:31,961 --> 00:39:33,271
Well done. Place one.

791
00:39:33,371 --> 00:39:36,400
(The three brothers
left their mark as well.)

792
00:39:36,401 --> 00:39:38,741
First, we have to go to the third floor.

793
00:39:39,001 --> 00:39:42,011
