they follow the eldest anyway.)

794
00:39:43,011 --> 00:39:44,410
This is really funny.

795
00:39:44,411 --> 00:39:47,450
We got all sweaty on the zipline,
and now we're at a hot spring.

796
00:39:47,451 --> 00:39:49,181
It'll really help us recharge.

797
00:39:50,421 --> 00:39:51,520
This is the place.

798
00:39:51,521 --> 00:39:52,791
Here it is.

799
00:39:53,451 --> 00:39:54,691
Large public bath.

800
00:39:54,991 --> 00:39:56,020
I'm curious.

801
00:39:56,021 --> 00:39:57,061
You're curious, right?

802
00:39:58,921 --> 00:40:01,231
And as you can see,
it's an outdoor hot spring.

803
00:40:01,961 --> 00:40:03,201
It's outside.

804
00:40:04,061 --> 00:40:06,331
The path to the hot spring
spot is quite interesting.

805
00:40:08,301 --> 00:40:10,471
- We're taking a cable car?
- That's right.

806
00:40:12,241 --> 00:40:13,641
We're going up there?

807
00:40:14,741 --> 00:40:17,080
- That's right.
- It goes up quite high.

808
00:40:17,081 --> 00:40:18,311
That's right.

809
00:40:18,711 --> 00:40:20,710
We have to go to a hot
spring in the mountain.

810
00:40:20,711 --> 00:40:22,157
