car, roughly 27 stories high)

811
00:40:22,181 --> 00:40:23,581
There is no operator.

812
00:40:25,051 --> 00:40:26,351
Yes.

813
00:40:28,921 --> 00:40:30,321
Come inside.

814
00:40:30,721 --> 00:40:32,831
It can fit up to ten people.

815
00:40:33,661 --> 00:40:36,601
This is the start button.

816
00:40:38,801 --> 00:40:40,471
It smells like cedar.

817
00:40:41,131 --> 00:40:42,431
It wouldn't be.

818
00:40:43,041 --> 00:40:44,740
What kind of wood is this?

819
00:40:44,741 --> 00:40:46,670
- Logs.
- They smell like logs.

820
00:40:46,671 --> 00:40:48,271
(Changing his words)

821
00:40:49,411 --> 00:40:52,210
(They set off for the
outdoor hot spring...)

822
00:40:52,211 --> 00:40:55,011
(riding a cable car filled
with the scent of wood.)

823
00:41:01,291 --> 00:41:02,790
The sound of crickets is soothing.

824
00:41:02,791 --> 00:41:05,361
(The sound of crickets is soothing.)

825
00:41:06,191 --> 00:41:07,431
It's nature.

826
00:41:08,991 --> 00:41:11,200
Children would love this place.
You could come with your family.

827
00:41:11,201 --> 00:41:12,261
Right.

828
00:41:14,631 --> 00:41:17,141
It's a small thing, but
this makes it interesting.

829
00:41:20,371 --> 00:41:25,041
(They arrived at the outdoor hot spring.)

830
00:41:25,311 --> 00:41:26,650
- Amazing.
- The water is clear.

831
00:41:26,651 --> 00:41:28,651
- It's like forest bathing.
- That's right.

832
00:41:32,221 --> 00:41:33,391
They did a good job here.

833
00:41:37,921 --> 00:41:40,561
(Past the entrance, where
wind chimes echo softly, )

834
00:41:40,991 --> 00:41:43,761
