path in a beautiful garden.)

835
00:41:44,831 --> 00:41:46,030
This one's for men.

836
00:41:46,031 --> 00:41:48,331
(The bath for men is on the side.)

837
00:41:49,001 --> 00:41:50,500
- Is this for women?
- Yes.

838
00:41:50,501 --> 00:41:53,271
(The women's bath is next to it.)

839
00:41:54,141 --> 00:41:55,511
Welcome back!

840
00:41:56,181 --> 00:41:59,581
There's a unique culture
in Japanese hot springs.

841
00:42:01,181 --> 00:42:03,681
(Gender-swapping baths)

842
00:42:04,121 --> 00:42:05,990
We alternate male and female baths...

843
00:42:05,991 --> 00:42:07,450
periodically.

844
00:42:07,451 --> 00:42:08,820
(Most hot springs do it.)

845
00:42:08,821 --> 00:42:10,501
