848
00:42:17,031 --> 00:42:18,730
(This is influenced by
traditional Japanese thought, )

849
00:42:18,731 --> 00:42:21,931
(which placed great emphasis on balance.)

850
00:42:25,871 --> 00:42:28,571
Our bath is at the top.

851
00:42:29,041 --> 00:42:30,181
This way, guys.

852
00:42:35,551 --> 00:42:36,721
