unfolds behind the door.)

854
00:42:40,191 --> 00:42:41,551
This is the best.

855
00:42:43,891 --> 00:42:45,061
Check it out.

856
00:42:45,861 --> 00:42:48,591
You can walk around
naked, and no one will see.

857
00:42:49,831 --> 00:42:51,131
Just watch out for birds.

858
00:42:54,371 --> 00:42:56,241
I could stay here all day.

859
00:42:58,601 --> 00:43:00,240
- Those birds...
- Look at those trees.

860
00:43:00,241 --> 00:43:01,440
(The Tsurugi Mountain Range spreads out...)

861
