far as the eye can see.)

862
00:43:15,091 --> 00:43:18,361
(This is an all-in-one destination
surrounded by Mother Nature.)

863
00:43:18,621 --> 00:43:20,961
You can't find this
anywhere else. How lovely.

864
00:43:21,691 --> 00:43:23,831
Japan has the best hot
springs on mountains.

865
00:43:24,561 --> 00:43:25,731
This is...

866
00:43:26,901 --> 00:43:29,131
- Check it out.
- That's insane.

867
00:43:29,871 --> 00:43:30,971
Goodness.

868
00:43:31,671 --> 00:43:32,740
Incredible.

869
00:43:32,741 --> 00:43:36,541
(An open-air hot spring
surrounded by Mother Nature)

870
00:43:38,281 --> 00:43:41,451
(Bathing in the hot water, )

871
00:43:42,211 --> 00:43:45,551
(you can fully appreciate
the beautiful landscape.)

872
00:43:49,791 --> 00:43:50,861
I love it!

873
00:43:51,661 --> 00:43:53,061
That feels good.

874
00:43:59,771 --> 00:44:01,070
It's hot!

875
00:44:01,071 --> 00:44:02,701
It's not that hot.

876
00:44:02,801 --> 00:44:04,741
