It's not that hot.

901
00:45:05,701 --> 00:45:06,800
This is hot for you?

902
00:45:06,801 --> 00:45:08,300
It's not that hot.

903
00:45:08,301 --> 00:45:10,671
It is hot. Isn't it?

904
00:45:11,441 --> 00:45:12,570
Nam Gil, are you going
to keep acting young?

905
00:45:12,571 --> 00:45:13,670
But it's hot.

906
00:45:13,671 --> 00:45:14,911
It's not that hot.

907
00:45:15,441 --> 00:45:16,681
- Go all in.
- Look.

908
00:45:18,681 --> 00:45:20,410
(When you're older, you get
less sensitive to temperature.)

909
00:45:20,411 --> 00:45:21,581
It feels so good.

910
00:45:22,611 --> 00:45:24,521
Seriously? It's so hot.

911
00:45:25,051 --> 00:45:26,521
Let's get some heat.

912
00:45:29,961 --> 00:45:32,720
You'll mislead the viewers.

913
00:45:32,721 --> 00:45:33,891
It's not that hot.

914
00:45:35,031 --> 00:45:36,501
You'll see. When you get older...

915
00:45:37,061 --> 00:45:38,231
It's hot.

916
00:45:38,631 --> 00:45:40,531
Nam Gil, stop acting like you're Gen Z.

917
00:45:41,771 --> 00:45:43,040
(Joon hands something over to Nam Gil...)

918
00:45:43,041 --> 00:45:44,070
That feels good.

919
00:45:44,071 --> 00:45:45,471
(who's struggling.)

920
00:45:46,171 --> 00:45:48,241
(You must have a small
towel soaked in cold water.)

921
