When you're inside, soak
a little towel in cold water...

924
00:46:00,251 --> 00:46:02,991
and put it on top of your head.

925
00:46:05,461 --> 00:46:06,731
That's good.

926
00:46:07,891 --> 00:46:09,031
I love it.

927
00:46:09,231 --> 00:46:12,201
(Your body feels hot,
and you feel relaxed.)

928
00:46:12,501 --> 00:46:16,871
(The younger ones also
realises the fun of hot springs.)

929
00:46:18,541 --> 00:46:19,641
I'm feeling drowsy.

930
00:46:21,111 --> 00:46:22,471
This is perfect.

931
00:46:25,741 --> 00:46:28,651
(While they're getting sleepy, )

932
00:46:29,551 --> 00:46:32,650
