- Bathe.
- Just bathe?

942
00:47:01,881 --> 00:47:03,681
The water suddenly feels hot.

943
00:47:03,821 --> 00:47:05,550
Oh, wait.

944
00:47:05,551 --> 00:47:07,471
- We have to go. It's time.
- It's actually hot.

945
00:47:07,651 --> 00:47:08,721
It's no joke.

946
00:47:09,221 --> 00:47:10,590
I actually feel...

947
