978
00:48:41,111 --> 00:48:43,051
Now, we look outside.

979
00:48:45,181 --> 00:48:46,351
I can do that.

980
00:48:49,651 --> 00:48:52,361
- It feels cool, right?
- This feels so good!

981
00:48:52,491 --> 00:48:54,367
- It's not hot at all, right?
- This is perfect.

982
00:48:54,391 --> 00:48:55,591
It feels good, Nam Gil.

983
00:49:00,931 --> 00:49:02,500
I shot down your opinions...

984
00:49:02,501 --> 00:49:04,017
- and brought you to a hot spring.
- Yes.

985
00:49:04,041 --> 00:49:05,977
Do you still resent me, or do
you think it was a good idea?

986
00:49:06,001 --> 00:49:07,010
I think it was a good idea,
now that I'm standing here.

987
00:49:07,011 --> 00:49:08,071
Right?

988
00:49:08,241 --> 00:49:09,761
And it's nice to soak in a hot spring.

989
00:49:13,511 --> 00:49:15,650
(The refreshing mountain
breeze cools their bodies...)

990
00:49:15,651 --> 00:49:18,081
(warmed by the hot spring.)

991
00:49:34,571 --> 00:49:40,411
(A therapeutic hot spring session
surrounded by lush greenery)

992
00:49:45,981 --> 00:49:47,051
That's nice.

993
00:49:51,051 --> 00:49:53,321
- Great work.
- Great job.

994
00:49:54,391 --> 00:49:55,691
- Man.
- Man.

995
00:49:56,521 --> 00:49:57,890
I'm drowsy.

996
00:49:57,891 --> 00:50:00,591
You feel sleepy, right? That's natural.

997
00:50:05,061 --> 00:50:08,231
(While the younger brothers
are passed out, the car travels.)

998
00:50:08,531 --> 00:50:10,900
(Past crystal-clear streams, )

999
00:50:10,901 --> 00:50:13,211
(past lush green trees, )

1000
00:50:13,911 --> 00:50:17,941
