1011
00:50:49,641 --> 00:50:51,841
You're not taking us
somewhere to sell us off, are you?

1012
00:50:52,141 --> 00:50:53,351
You'll see when we get there.

1013
00:50:57,681 --> 00:50:59,380
(Hot springs)

1014
00:50:59,381 --> 00:51:02,391
(Nagoro Village)

1015
00:51:03,151 --> 00:51:04,760
Where are we?

1016
00:51:04,761 --> 00:51:05,921
Let's get out.

1017
00:51:13,701 --> 00:51:15,471
Let's take a look around.

1018
00:51:16,771 --> 00:51:20,511
