- What?

1025
00:51:36,491 --> 00:51:37,920
There's something here.

1026
00:51:37,921 --> 00:51:39,161
He's talking to you.

1027
00:51:39,461 --> 00:51:40,731
Oh, my.

1028
00:51:41,291 --> 00:51:42,491
